---
---

<section
  data-testid="focus"
  id="focus"
  class="flex flex-col items-start justify-center py-20 md:py-28"
>
  <div class="mb-8 flex items-center gap-3 w-full">
    <span class="font-mono text-accent text-sm">02.</span>
    <h2 class="font-mono text-2xl text-white lg:text-3xl">Focus Areas</h2>
    <div class="h-px flex-1 bg-border"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid w-full gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
    <div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface p-6 transition-colors hover:border-accent/40">
      <h3 class="mb-3 font-mono text-lg text-accent">AI Agent Infrastructure</h3>
      <p class="mb-3 text-sm text-white/80">
        Agent visibility auditing, agent-readable web surfaces, MCP servers,
        agent skills, and orchestration frameworks for multi-agent workflows.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 font-mono text-xs text-muted">
        <span class="rounded border border-border px-2 py-1">FastAPI</span>
        <span class="rounded border border-border px-2 py-1">Next.js</span>
        <span class="rounded border border-border px-2 py-1">Hermes Agent</span>
        <span class="rounded border border-border px-2 py-1">MCP</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface p-6 transition-colors hover:border-accent/40">
      <h3 class="mb-3 font-mono text-lg text-accent">ML Research</h3>
      <p class="mb-3 text-sm text-white/80">
        Meaning grounding in language models, compositional generalization,
        visual grounding, and controlled experiments with matched model
        comparisons.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 font-mono text-xs text-muted">
        <span class="rounded border border-border px-2 py-1">PyTorch</span>
        <span class="rounded border border-border px-2 py-1">H2O AutoML</span>
        <span class="rounded border border-border px-2 py-1">scikit-learn</span>
        <span class="rounded border border-border px-2 py-1">NumPy</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface p-6 transition-colors hover:border-accent/40">
      <h3 class="mb-3 font-mono text-lg text-accent">Backend &amp; Data</h3>
      <p class="mb-3 text-sm text-white/80">
        API design, SSRF-safe fetch pipelines, scoring engines, structured data
        validation, and data engineering for audit and analytics systems.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 font-mono text-xs text-muted">
        <span class="rounded border border-border px-2 py-1">Python</span>
        <span class="rounded border border-border px-2 py-1">SQL</span>
        <span class="rounded border border-border px-2 py-1">Pydantic</span>
        <span class="rounded border border-border px-2 py-1">Pandas</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface p-6 transition-colors hover:border-accent/40">
      <h3 class="mb-3 font-mono text-lg text-accent">LLM Evaluation</h3>
      <p class="mb-3 text-sm text-white/80">
        LLM evaluation pipelines, RLHF task experience, citation measurement,
        and structured output validation for agentic systems.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 font-mono text-xs text-muted">
        <span class="rounded border border-border px-2 py-1">Ollama</span>
        <span class="rounded border border-border px-2 py-1">OpenAI API</span>
        <span class="rounded border border-border px-2 py-1">RLHF</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface p-6 transition-colors hover:border-accent/40">
      <h3 class="mb-3 font-mono text-lg text-accent">DevOps &amp; CI/CD</h3>
      <p class="mb-3 text-sm text-white/80">
        GitHub Actions, pre-commit hooks, automated testing, public/private repo
        boundaries, and reproducible research pipelines.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 font-mono text-xs text-muted">
        <span class="rounded border border-border px-2 py-1">GitHub Actions</span>
        <span class="rounded border border-border px-2 py-1">Docker</span>
        <span class="rounded border border-border px-2 py-1">Azure</span>
        <span class="rounded border border-border px-2 py-1">uv</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface p-6 transition-colors hover:border-accent/40">
      <h3 class="mb-3 font-mono text-lg text-accent">Domain Expertise</h3>
      <p class="mb-3 text-sm text-white/80">
        Financial services (Series 7, 66, SIE), wealth management operations,
        compliance workflows, and cross-cultural communication across US, China,
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 font-mono text-xs text-muted">
        <span class="rounded border border-border px-2 py-1">FINRA Licensed</span>
        <span class="rounded border border-border px-2 py-1">Mandarin</span>
        <span class="rounded border border-border px-2 py-1">Bilingual</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>